---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Education & Courses"
  description="Master the art and technique of photography with the National Photographic Art Society of Sri Lanka. Comprehensive Diploma in Photography and free island-wide school examinations."
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="bg-neutral-900/60 border-b border-neutral-800 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400">NPAS Academic Studies</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Photographic Education</h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed px-4">
        Serving the photographic community since 1950 by providing premier education, practical field training, and academic qualifications.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Overview Section -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-neutral-950 border-b border-neutral-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Fostering Generations of Sri Lankan Photographers</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          The National Photographic Art Society has served as the cradle for Sri Lanka's leading photojournalists, commercial photographers, and creative artists. The educational wing is guided by the Director of Education and a veteran faculty of distinction holders.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Academic Programs -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-neutral-900/30">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16 sm:space-y-24">
      
      <!-- Program 1: Diploma in Photography -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl flex flex-col lg:flex-row">
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 relative min-h-[300px] sm:min-h-[400px] bg-neutral-950">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/education/edu-dip.jpg"
            alt="Diploma in Photography"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-neutral-950 via-transparent to-transparent lg:hidden"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              Flagship Academic Program
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Diploma in Photography</h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Our comprehensive diploma curriculum bridges classical visual fundamentals with modern digital mastery. Students explore camera optics, exposure control, lighting setups, studio portraiture, creative landscape compositions, and professional digital post-production.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pt-4 space-y-3">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-200">Key Curriculum Highlights:</h4>
              <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Photographic Optics & Sensor Tech
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Studio & Natural Light Mastery
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Composition & Visual Semiotics
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Post-Processing & Color Management
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Practical Field Work & Workshops
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Portfolio Review & Convocation
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-neutral-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a
              href="mailto:sisira.ts@gmail.com?subject=Diploma in Photography Inquiry"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-center transition-all shadow-md"
            >
              Inquire / Register For Next Intake
            </a>
            <a
              href="tel:+94717189038"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-neutral-200 font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider text-center border border-neutral-700 transition-all"
            >
              Contact Director Education (+94 717 189 038)
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Program 2: School Examination of Photography -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse">
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 relative min-h-[300px] sm:min-h-[400px] bg-neutral-950">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/education/edu-scl.jpg"
            alt="School Examination of Photography"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-neutral-950 via-transparent to-transparent lg:hidden"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              Community & Youth Project
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Examination of Photography for Schools</h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Initiated by founder late Mr. Wilson Hegoda, NPAS conducts nationwide photography examinations for school students completely free of charge. This CSR initiative nurtures artistic observation and visual literacy in young students across the country.
            </p>

            <div class="pt-4 space-y-3">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-200">School Examination Features:</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-neutral-400">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-sky-400">✓</span> Conducted annually for secondary school students island-wide
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-sky-400">✓</span> Free examination registration and educational guidance
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-sky-400">✓</span> Certified credentials presented to successful candidates
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-sky-400">✓</span> Opportunity to enter youth categories at the National Exhibition
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-neutral-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a
              href="mailto:npas@sltnet.lk?subject=School Photography Examination Application"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-center border border-neutral-700 transition-all"
            >
              Register Your School
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
